xlcost_1140.java_algorithm:
Function divSum(n):
  sum = 1
  for i from 2 to sqrt(n) inclusive:
    if n % i == 0:
      sum = sum + i + n // i
  return sum
Function areEquivalent(num1, num2):
  return divSum(num1) == divSum(num2)
